          "text": "Ngalolo suku ngiyobenzela isivumelwano nezilwane zasendle, nezinyoni zezulu, nezilwanyana ezinwabuzelayo emhlabeni; ngiyakwaphula umnsalo, nenkemba, nempi emhlabeni, futhi uyobayeka balale belondekile.",
